# CODEOWNERS — automatic reviewer requests based on file paths.
# Syntax: <space-separated path pattern> <space-separated @user or @org/team handles>
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Every rule is inactive until one is uncommented with a real handle,
# or the samples should be deleted.

# Default owner for everything in the repository:
# *       @ORG/TEAM

# Examples:
# /src/    @ORG/TEAM
# /docs/   @ORG/TEAM
# *.md     @ORG/TEAM
